# Toolkit policy

How Claude works with you by default is not in this file. It lives in the toolkit
checkout at `policy/CLAUDE.md` and loads in every session through one import line
that `/onboard` adds to `~/.claude/CLAUDE.md`, so updating the toolkit updates it.
This file may adjust anything that policy calls a default (tone, working
preferences), and may add stops of its own; to change more than that, turn the
import off and carry your own policy.
